      "system": {
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>I'm Burning! </strong><span class=\"pf2-icon\">R</span> <strong>Trigger</strong> Haunted creature enters the room; Creature must succeed a @Check[type:will|dc:23|name:Suggestion|traits:mental,incapacitating,linguistic,necromancy,occult]save or throw themsehres through the window depicting Arazni, dealing 2[[/r (2d8+7)[slashing]]] damage from landing roughly on the roof. The character must then succeed a DC23 basic reﬂex save against [[/r (2d8+7)[piercing]]] damage to catch themsehres from falling off the roof and into a weather vane. On a critical failure, instead of taking critical damage as they would normally, the creature slides to the edge of the roof. The creature can take the grab an edge reaction against @Check[type:reflex|dc:15|name:Suggestion|traits:mental,incapacitating,linguistic,necromancy,occult]save to avoid falling 300 feet to the rocky surf below {taking 150 damage in the process).</p>"
