    "details": {
      "isComplex": true,
      "level": {
        "value": 5
      },
      "disable": "<p>@Check[type:occultism|dc:23|name:To Banish Haunt|traits:complex,haunt] (expert) To Banish Haunt,</p>\n<p>@Check[type:religion|dc:23|name: To Banish Haunt|traits:complex,haunt] (expert) To Banish Haunt,</p>\n<p>@Check[type:perception|dc:20|name:To Notice Stink of Burning Flesh|traits:complex,haunt] (trained) To Notice Stink of Burning Flesh.<br />@Check[type:perception|dc:26|name:To Notice Character is Possessed|traits:complex,haunt] (trained) To Notice Character is Possessed.</p>",
      "description": "<p style=\"text-align:justify\">You suddenly feel uncomfortably hot. You are on fire! The only way to put the flames out before you burns to death is to throw yourself through the unbroken window into the sea below.</p>",
      "reset": "<p>The haunt automatically resets after 1 day until the supernatural fungus in B37 is dealt with, even if the haunt was previously disabled.</p>",
      "routine": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Burning Haunt: </strong>This Haunt only targets creatures haunted by Cyralie Foxglove, who tried to burn the manor to stop her husband from being diven mad. if no creatures in a group are haunted by Cyrdie Foxglove, the haunt may&nbsp;target any creature.</p>"
